PTX tensormap+release-fences-only
"tensormap.replace, two fence.proxy.tensormap::generic.release, then a tensor copy through the map. The tensormap proxy fences order the generic proxy before the tensormap proxy only as a release-acquire pair (9.7.13.4, D37); with no acquire fence the copy may still use the old map: allowed."
{
g=5;
d=0 @cta 0;
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
tm=0;
P0:r2=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                                                                         ;
 tensormap.replace.tile.global_address.global.b1024.b64 tm, 1                                     ;
 fence.proxy.tensormap::generic.release.gpu                                                       ;
 fence.proxy.tensormap::generic.release.gpu                                                       ;
 cp.async.bulk.tensor.1d.shared::cluster.global.tile.mbarrier::complete_tx::bytes d, g, b, tm, r2 ;
exists
(P0:r2 == 0)
